<title>USA: Tiffany indicated higher after strong Q1.</title>
<headline>Tiffany indicated higher after strong Q1.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Tiffany &amp; Co Inc had not yet opened for trading but were indicated higher on the New York Stock Exchange after the jeweler posted stronger than expected first quarter earnings.</p>
<p>Shares were indicated at between $45 and $48, according to the New York Stock Exchange, compared to their last trade at 43-3/8.</p>
</text>
